[{"answer":"Greek Island Holidays, can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I hope so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I have a friend who's just come back from Corfu","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and she's recommended some apartments in Arilas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/4.mp3"},{"answer":"She thought they might be on your list.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Arilas, Arilas... let me see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you give me the names?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, the first's Rose Garden Apartments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to go with another friend in the last week of October.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we've got a lovely studio flat available at that time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you'd enjoy the entertainment programme there too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/11.mp3"},{"answer":"with Greek dancing in the restaurant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/12.mp3"},{"answer":"And the cost for each of us?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/13.mp3"},{"answer":"£219.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/14.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds very reasonable!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm just jotting down some notes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Now the second one she mentioned was called Blue Bay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Blue Bay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, in fact that's very popular and it has some special features.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/20.mp3"},{"answer":"The main attraction is the large swimming pool with salt water.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Much healthier, I understand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/22.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/23.mp3"},{"answer":"And it isn't far from the beach, either - only 300 metres,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and only around half a kilometre to some shops,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/25.mp3"},{"answer":"so you don't have to be too energetic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it much more expensive than the first one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me just check.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I think at the time you want to go it's around £260","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/29.mp3"},{"answer":"No, £275 to be exact.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, I've got that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Now there are just two more apartments to ask you about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, I can't read my own writing!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Something to do with sun... Sunshine, is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I think you meant the Sunshade Apartments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/35.mp3"},{"answer":"They're on a mountainside.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Any special features?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, each room has its own sun terrace","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/38.mp3"},{"answer":"and there are shared barbecue facilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, sounds lovely!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it is rather well-equipped.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/41.mp3"},{"answer":"It also provides water sports, it has its own beach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/42.mp3"},{"answer":"There are facilities for water-skiing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Any kite-surfing? My friend's quite keen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Not at the hotel but I'm sure you'll find some in Arilas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/45.mp3"},{"answer":"There's also satellite TV in the apartments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/46.mp3"},{"answer":"And how much is that one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/47.mp3"},{"answer":"£490 with two sharing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/48.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean £245 each?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid not!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Each person has to pay that amount and there must be at least two in an apartment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think that would be within our budget, unfortunately.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And the last one sounds a bit expensive too - the Grand!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually it's quite reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/54.mp3"},{"answer":"It's an older style house with Greek paintings in every room, and a balcony outside.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds nice. What are the views like?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there are forests all round and they hide a supermarket just down the road,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/57.mp3"},{"answer":"so that's very useful for all your shopping needs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/58.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a disco in the area too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/59.mp3"},{"answer":"And the price?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/60.mp3"},{"answer":"£319 at that time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/61.mp3"},{"answer":"but if you leave it till November it goes down by 40%.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... Too late, I'm afraid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, why don't i send you a brochure with full details, Ms...?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Nash.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/65.mp3"},{"answer":"But don't worry about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm coming to Upminster soon and I'll call and get one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I just wanted to get an idea first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Uhh... We've got plenty here when you come.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/70.mp3"},{"answer":"If you've got a minute, could I just check a couple of points about insurance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I got one policy through the post but I'd like to see if yours is better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/73.mp3"},{"answer":"What would you like to know?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the one I've got has benefits and then the maximum amount you can claim.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that like yours?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's how most of them are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the first thing is cancellation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/78.mp3"},{"answer":"If the holiday's cancelled on the policy I've got, you can claim £8,000.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/79.mp3"},{"answer":"We can improve on that, Ms Nash.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/80.mp3"},{"answer":"For Greek Island holidays, our maximum is £10,000.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/81.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good - of course our holiday won't even cost £1,000 together!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/82.mp3"},{"answer":"It's still sensible to have good cover.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, if you go to hospital, we allow £600.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, mine's similar.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/85.mp3"},{"answer":"And we also allow a relative to travel to your holiday resort.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/86.mp3"},{"answer":"My policy just says their representative will help you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/87.mp3"},{"answer":"You can see there's another difference there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/88.mp3"},{"answer":"And what happens if you don't get on the plane?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Nothing, as far as I can see on this form.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't you have missed departure?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/91.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'll just jot that down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/92.mp3"},{"answer":"We pay up to £1,000 for that, depending on the reason.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/93.mp3"},{"answer":"And we're particularly generous about loss of personal belongings -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/94.mp3"},{"answer":"up to £3,000, but not more than £500 for a single item.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/95.mp3"},{"answer":"Then I'd better not take my laptop!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/96.mp3"},{"answer":"Not unless you insure it separately.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/97.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, thanks very much for your time, you've really been helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/98.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I get back to you? Your name is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/99.mp3"},{"answer":"Ben Ludlow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/100.mp3"},{"answer":"That's LUDLOW.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/101.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm the Assistant Manager here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/102.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll give you my number.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/103.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 081260543216.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/104.mp3"},{"answer":"But didn't I phone 081260567294?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/105.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what I've got on the paper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/106.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the main switchboard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/107.mp3"},{"answer":"I've given you my direct line.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/108.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, thank you very much for your time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-1-2023-07-23-15-04-38/109.mp3"}]
